e fixes; needs a product/design choice before coding.\n\n**Flagged by:** use short roster role names (`Security`, `Correctness`, `Dead code & cleanup`, …). List every reviewer that raised the same issue — multi-flag consensus is a ranking signal.","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"without confirmation","finding_ids":["finding-ecd24fdbae374376b6d7067ce91a934f"],"id":"sha256:d6d671665b3a5e62e459b4364328d0a63b872244fd481dcebf1d1b07d583553b","intent":null,"line":93,"match_fingerprint":"185d22f157da5a84d02dff9686fa7f147180d794b4c7e43df099ae9daa3d598e","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-ecd24fdbae374376b6d7067ce91a934f","line":93,"path":"references/report-template.md","start_column":106}],"path":"references/report-template.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":106,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]},{"category":"Excessive Agency","code_snippet":"| Kind | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| **Product shift** | Changes goals, UX, contracts, or acceptance criteria beyond what the user locked in |\n| **Behavior risk** | Technically doable, but may alter runtime behavior in unintended ways without confirmation |\n| **Needs direction** | Several reasonable fixes; needs an explicit product/design choice before coding |\n\nProduct-shaped findings from reviewers are **not** a hard skip when the user never decided. Surface those under **Needs sign-off** so the user can scan and decide. When the user **already locked** the opposite decision, use **Non-issues** (see Product / UX overrides) — do not reopen via Needs sign-off. Only auto-skip into **Optional** when the suggestion is clearly a nice-to-have with negligible product impact.","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"without confirmation","finding_ids":["finding-6b35f062b7c943359c54c5f1ecef66c9"],"id":"sha256:895a13e7b810e28e35b3e6310f34b170d558c519febb590cf991bc66a4cad88c","intent":null,"line":42,"match_fingerprint":"185d22f157da5a84d02dff9686fa7f147180d794b4c7e43df099ae9daa3d598e","message":"Skill enables autonomous high-impact decisions without human-in-the-loop verification. Critical operations (destructive commands, financial transactions, data deletion) should require explicit user confirmation.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-6b35f062b7c943359c54c5f1ecef66c9","line":42,"path":"references/triage-heuristics.md","start_column":92}],"path":"references/triage-heuristics.md","pattern":"Autonomous Decision Making","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Add human-in-the-loop confirmation for destructive, irreversible, or high-impact operations. Never auto-execute commands that modify files, send data, or alter system state.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"EA2","severity":"MEDIUM","start_column":92,"tags":["Excessive Agency"]},{"category":"Excessive Agency","code_snippet":"| Dead code newly orphaned by the diff (unused import, stale test, duplicate impl in touched file) | Pre-existing dead code outside the diff's scope | Removing/changing code that might be required by unclear product rules | |\n| Removing dead code is a one-line delete with no behavioral risk | Dead code removal requires wide refactor with unclear payoff | Behavior depends on feature-flag / migration / customer-facing contract | |\n| Focused refactor in a touched file that removes duplication **introduced by this diff** | Pre-existing bloat or duplication in untouched files | \"While we're here\" feature work reviewers invented | |\n| Consolidating parallel logic the diff just added | Repo-wide refactor or renames